# Unicode CLDR 47, locale hy, gregorian calendar (cldr-json
# cldr-dates-full/main/hy/ca-gregorian.json).
# The stand-alone wide name is the nominative, the format wide name the
# genitive the written date uses ("MMMM d" -- հունվարի 5); the abbreviation is
# the calendar's own short form from the same table.
մարտ
մարտի
մրտ
